Don't just turn away and leave it all to me.

761
01:01:01,119 --> 01:01:05,419
ねぇほら夢中にさせちゃうわ ああ
Hey, look, I'll make you completely head over heels, ah!

762
01:01:05,419 --> 01:01:08,519
ずっとずっと好きで居たいの
I want to love you forever and ever.

763
01:01:08,519 --> 01:01:11,519
過去の君も今の君もそう変わらない
The past you and the present you haven't changed a bit.

764
01:01:11,519 --> 01:01:14,119
こっち向いててよダーリン
Look this way, darling!

765
01:01:14,119 --> 01:01:16,519
あーもう離さないから
Ah, I won't let you go anymore,

766
01:01:16,519 --> 01:01:23,319
絶対に 絶対ね 絶対よ 約束だよ
Absolutely, okay? Absolutely! It's a promise!

767
01:01:45,819 --> 01:01:48,819
愛しちゃうもっと
I'll love you even more!

768
01:02:08,519 --> 01:02:10,319
This next song is our last song!

769
01:02:10,319 --> 01:02:13,319
Let's continue to love Hololive much and more!

770
01:02:13,319 --> 01:02:18,319
いつの間にか見つけてた遠い夢
A distant dream I found before I knew it,

771
01:02:18,319 --> 01:02:23,519
一人じゃ見えなかった景色
scenery that couldn't be seen alone.

772
01:02:23,519 --> 01:02:29,119
波打つ風の音と 加速していく想いに
To the sound of the rippling wind and accelerating feelings,

773
01:02:29,119 --> 01:02:33,519
戸惑いを覚えた
I felt confused.

774
01:02:33,819 --> 01:02:38,319
ずっと追いかけた理想の姿は
The ideal image I've chased for so long

775
01:02:38,319 --> 01:02:43,319
まだ届かなくて遠いけど
is still unreachable and far away, but...

776
01:02:43,819 --> 01:02:49,319
きっとこの瞬間を かけがえのないみんなで
Surely, during this moment, with everyone who is irreplaceable,

777
01:02:49,319 --> 01:02:51,819
共に行くよ！
we'll go together!

778
01:02:51,819 --> 01:02:53,319
手を繋いで
Hand in hand,

779
01:02:53,319 --> 01:02:54,819
3・2・1！
3, 2, 1!

780
01:02:54,819 --> 01:02:57,519
輝き宿して
Harboring brilliance,

781
01:02:57,519 --> 01:03:00,119
夢の場所へ！
to our dream place!

782
01:03:00,119 --> 01:03:07,819
駆け抜けていく 僕たちの青春の光は
Running through, the light of our youth

783
01:03:07,819 --> 01:03:11,319
誰にも止められないよ！
can't be stopped by anyone!

784
01:03:11,319 --> 01:03:14,119
笑い合う分だけ優しく
Just as gently as we laugh together,

785
01:03:14,119 --> 01:03:16,519
零れる涙さえ今
even the spilling tears now,

786
01:03:16,519 --> 01:03:18,519
ほら輝かせ
look, make them shine!

787
01:03:18,519 --> 01:03:23,119
明日へ運ぶから君の隣へ
I'll carry them to tomorrow, right to your side!

788
01:03:23,119 --> 01:03:28,319
僕たちは世界を超えて行く
We will go beyond the world!

789
01:03:28,319 --> 01:03:34,119
迎えに行くよ まだ見えない明日も
I'll come pick you up! Even for a tomorrow not yet visible,

790
01:03:34,119 --> 01:03:37,519
キラメキに変えてきっと
changing it into sparkle, surely

791
01:03:37,519 --> 01:03:41,119
僕たちが未来へと
we will take you...

792
01:03:41,119 --> 01:03:44,319
連れて行くから！
to the future!

793
01:03:51,119 --> 01:03:56,319
背伸びしては手を伸ばす憧れの
Reaching up on tiptoe, stretching towards our admiration,

794
01:03:56,319 --> 01:04:01,319
行き先示す星になろう
let's become the star showing the way.

795
01:04:01,319 --> 01:04:06,319
つまずくその度に 手を差し伸べ合えたら
Every time we stumble, if we can reach out to each other,

796
01:04:06,319 --> 01:04:11,319
すぐに届くはずさ
it should reach us soon.

797
01:04:11,319 --> 01:04:16,319
そっと踏み出した小さな勇気が
The small courage gently taken forward,

798
01:04:16,319 --> 01:04:22,319
もう消えないように繋げよう
let's connect it so it never fades away!

799
01:04:22,319 --> 01:04:27,319
不安も愛しさも大切に抱きしめて
Holding both anxiety and affection dear to our hearts,

800
01:04:27,319 --> 01:04:29,819
共に行くよ！
we'll go together!

801
01:04:29,819 --> 01:04:31,319
目を合わせて
Looking into each other's eyes,

802
01:04:31,319 --> 01:04:32,519
3・2・1！
3, 2, 1!

803
01:04:32,519 --> 01:04:37,519
晴れ渡る希望へ飛び出せるよ！
We can leap out toward clear hope!

804
01:04:37,519 --> 01:04:40,319
突き抜けていく
Breaking through,

805
01:04:40,319 --> 01:04:45,319
僕たちの透き通る決意は
our crystal-clear determination

806
01:04:45,319 --> 01:04:48,519
まだまだ止められないよ！
still can't be stopped!

807
01:04:48,519 --> 01:04:51,319
ありきたりな今日こそ
Turning even an ordinary day today

808
01:04:51,319 --> 01:04:54,319
トキメキに変えてもっと
into excitement and more,

809
01:04:54,319 --> 01:04:58,319
僕たちがいつまでも
because we will always

810
01:04:58,319 --> 01:05:00,319
背中押すから！
push you forward!

811
01:05:10,440 --> 01:05:13,340
Ruffians, we have something we want to share with you!

812
01:05:13,440 --> 01:05:16,840
It's now been three years since we made our debut here in hololive!

813
01:05:17,140 --> 01:05:20,640
There's been so many precious memories made, laughs together...

814
01:05:20,740 --> 01:05:24,340
...and even some tears through rough times, too.

815
01:05:24,840 --> 01:05:28,140
It's been lots of challenges, but it's all been worth it!

816
01:05:28,240 --> 01:05:32,840
All the 22 dreams we talked about three years ago have been coming true one by one!

817
01:05:33,140 --> 01:05:37,640
And now, our dream of our own first full album is coming true, too!

818
01:05:37,740 --> 01:05:39,840
Yeah! We're so grateful and thankful!

819
01:05:40,140 --> 01:05:43,340
We want to continue on this journey no matter what comes our way!

820
01:05:43,440 --> 01:05:46,640
As long as we're together, we know that we can do the impossible!

821
01:05:47,140 --> 01:05:49,540
Thank you for being our precious Ruffians!

822
01:05:49,540 --> 01:05:53,340
Here by our side, we'll continue to protect your smiles forever and ever!

823
01:05:53,640 --> 01:05:55,540
Bow wow!

824
01:05:56,540 --> 01:06:00,340
くだらない日常で描いていた
In the dull everyday life I used to paint,

825
01:06:00,340 --> 01:06:05,340
いつからか過去のライトになって
somehow it became a light from the past.

826
01:06:05,340 --> 01:06:11,340
満たす少しずつ 描ける大好きを紡ぎ
Little by little filling it up, weaving the things I love to paint,

827
01:06:11,340 --> 01:06:17,140
どこまでも高く
reaching endlessly high!

828
01:06:17,140 --> 01:06:21,340
明日色の空へ
Toward the sky colored with tomorrow,

829
01:06:21,340 --> 01:06:25,340
駆け抜けていく
we sprint through!

830
01:06:25,340 --> 01:06:28,140
僕たちの青春の光は
The light of our youth,

831
01:06:28,140 --> 01:06:31,840
誰にも止められないよ
no one can ever stop it!

832
01:06:31,840 --> 01:06:36,840
笑い合う毎日に こぼれる涙さえ
In the days we laugh together, even the spilled tears,

833
01:06:36,840 --> 01:06:41,340
ほら輝かせ 明日へ運ぶから
look, they shine as we carry them into tomorrow.

834
01:06:41,340 --> 01:06:43,340
君の隣へ
To your side,

835
01:06:43,340 --> 01:06:45,840
僕たちは
we will...

836
01:06:45,840 --> 01:06:49,140
世界を超えていく
...soar beyond the world,

837
01:06:49,140 --> 01:06:52,340
迎えに行くよ
and come to meet you!

838
01:06:52,340 --> 01:06:57,540
まだ見えない明日も ひらめきに変えて
Turning even the unseen tomorrow into inspiration,

839
01:06:57,540 --> 01:07:03,140
きっと僕たちが未来へと
surely we will head toward the future!

840
01:07:03,140 --> 01:07:07,340
果てのない未来へと
Toward an endless future,

841
01:07:07,340 --> 01:07:12,140
連れて行くから
we will take you along!

842
01:07:28,340 --> 01:07:54,340
[Thank you for 3 Years!!] It's because of you that we can shine so bright! The diary of memories we've made together these past 3 years means everything to us! - Fuwawa, Mococo

843
01:07:54,340 --> 01:08:24,340
We're looking forward to even more memories in the future! No matter what, we'll continue to become even stronger demon dogs so we can protect your smile furrever and ever! - Fuwawa, Mococo

